{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05669","headline":"故程将军妻南阳郡夫人樊氏挽歌 · 孙逖","name":"故程将军妻南阳郡夫人樊氏挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德配程休甫，名高鲁季姜。\n宠荣苍玉佩，宴梦郁金堂。\n白日期偕老，幽泉忽悼亡。\n国风犹在咏，江汉近南阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}